:: Deadwood Coldmoon Harbour Zephyr Widgets [widget]

<<widget 'deadwood-harbour-zephyr-link'>>
  <<deadwood-coin-zephyr-link>>
  <<if !maplebirch.get('MoreTransformations') or !$MoreTransformations?.harbour?.ship or !C.npc.Zephyr.init
      or $replayScene or $statFreeze or $frozenValues or $combat or $possessed or $nextPassage or $nextPassageCheck>><<exit>><</if>>
  <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink [
    $MoreTransformations.harbour.zephyr.stage is 3 ? 'Bring up the recovered cargo' : 'Ask about Coldmoon Harbour',
    $MoreTransformations.harbour.zephyr.stage is 3 ? '提起找回的货物' : '问问寒月港湾的事'
  ] 'Deadwood Coldmoon Harbour Zephyr'>>
    <<set $MoreTransformations.harbour.zephyr.origin to $passage>>
    <<if $MoreTransformations.harbour.zephyr.stage is 0>><<set $MoreTransformations.harbour.zephyr.stage to 1>><</if>>
  <</lanLink>><br>
<</widget>>

:: Deadwood Coldmoon Harbour Zephyr
<<effects>><<deadwood-harbour-context>>
<<if $nextPassage or $nextPassageCheck>>
  <span id='next'><<lanLink ['Next', '继续'] $passage>><</lanLink>></span><<nexttext>><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<if C.npc.Zephyr.init and _harbour.ship and _harbour.zephyr.stage gt 0>>
  <<npc 'Zephyr'>><<person1>>
  <<switch _harbour.zephyr.stage>>
    <<case 1>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          You tell Zephyr about the ship in the fog. <<He>> stops smiling. "Torn black sails? Crew dripping seawater? Aye, I know that lot. Keep an eye on yer belongings around them."
          <br><br>
          <<if $zephyr_seen is 'wraith' or visited('Wraith Snatched Pirate Railing 2') gt 0>>
            "And don't go following anything that calls from the water." <<He>> taps the telescope at <<his>> hip. "I'm not fishing ye out every time."
          <<else>>
            "Keep watch over the rail when the sea turns red. And leave the voices in the water alone."
          <</if>>
          <br><br>
          "They took some of me cargo last time," <<he>> says. "Small chest, red cord round the lid. When that ship comes in, they drag their loot under the old quay steps." <<He>> watches you over <<his>> mug. "Bring it back, and I'll pay ye."
        <<option 'CN'>>
          你向泽菲尔提起雾中的船。<<He>>收起笑容。“破黑帆？船员浑身淌水？老子知道那帮家伙。碰上他们，记得看紧自己的东西。”
          <br><br>
          <<if $zephyr_seen is 'wraith' or visited('Wraith Snatched Pirate Railing 2') gt 0>>
            “还有，再听见水底下有东西叫你，别跟着走。”<<He>>拍了拍腰间的望远镜。“可别指望我每次都去捞你。”
          <<else>>
            “血海之夜，多留意船边。水底下有什么动静，也别随便跟过去。”
          <</if>>
          <br><br>
          “他们上回抢了老子的货，”<<he>>说，“一只小箱子，箱盖上扎着红绳。那艘船靠岸时，他们就把东西往旧码头石阶底下拖。”<<He>>隔着酒杯打量你。“给我找回来，少不了你的报酬。”
      <</language>><br><br>
      <<if $spear_vessel is 'Zephyr'>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            "Ye've found something I wanted before. Let's see ye do it again." <<His>> grin returns. "Any other treasures of mine, leave 'em be."
          <<option 'CN'>>
            “你以前倒是找到过合我心意的东西，让我再瞧瞧你的本事。”<<He>>又笑了起来。“不过，我别的宝贝，见了可别乱碰。”
        <</language>><br><br>
      <</if>>
      <<set _zephyrFee to $pirate_rank is 1 ? 12000 : 8000>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          <<if $pirate_rank is 1>>"A mate gets a better share."<<else>>"This doesn't make ye part of me crew. Just a job."<</if>> <<He>> offers you <<printmoney _zephyrFee>>.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          <<if $pirate_rank is 1>>“自己人，自然多分一点。”<<else>>“可别以为这就算入伙了，只是一桩买卖。”<</if>><<He>>答应付你<<printmoney _zephyrFee>>。
      <</language>><br><br>
      <<icon 'coldmoon-harbour/red-cord-chest.png'>><<lanLink ['Agree to recover the chest', '答应找回箱子'] 'Deadwood Coldmoon Harbour Zephyr Deal'>>
        <<if $MoreTransformations.harbour.zephyr.stage is 1 and maplebirch.get('MoreTransformations')
          and !$combat and !$replayScene and !$statFreeze and !$frozenValues and !$possessed and !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck>>
          <<set $MoreTransformations.harbour.zephyr.fee to $pirate_rank is 1 ? 12000 : 8000>>
          <<set $MoreTransformations.harbour.zephyr.stage to 2, $MoreTransformations.harbour.scene to 'zephyrDeal'>>
        <</if>>
      <</lanLink>><br>
      <<set $skulduggerydifficulty to $pirate_rank is 1 ? 300 : 400>>
      <<socialiseicon>><<lanLink ['Agree and haggle over your share', '答应找箱子并谈谈价'] 'Deadwood Coldmoon Harbour Zephyr Deal'>>
        <<if $MoreTransformations.harbour.zephyr.stage is 1 and maplebirch.get('MoreTransformations')
          and !$combat and !$replayScene and !$statFreeze and !$frozenValues and !$possessed and !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck>>
          <<set $skulduggerydifficulty to $pirate_rank is 1 ? 300 : 400>>
          <<skulduggerycheck 'silent'>><<skulduggeryuse>>
          <<set $MoreTransformations.harbour.zephyr.fee to ($pirate_rank is 1 ? 12000 : 8000) + ($skulduggerysuccess is 1 ? 4000 : 0)>>
          <<set $MoreTransformations.harbour.zephyr.stage to 2, $MoreTransformations.harbour.scene to $skulduggerysuccess is 1 ? 'zephyrBargain' : 'zephyrRefused'>>
        <</if>>
      <</lanLink>><<skulduggerydifficulty>><br>
    <<case 2>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          "No chest?" Zephyr raises an eyebrow. "No pay, then. That was the deal."
          <br><br>
          <<He>> sets <<his>> mug down. "Wait for the blood moon, then dive under the steps at Coldmoon Harbour. Follow the mooring chain. Look for red cord round the lid, and don't let the dead catch ye rummaging through their loot."
        <<option 'CN'>>
          “箱子呢？”泽菲尔挑起眉。“没箱子就没钱，说好的。”
          <br><br>
          <<He>>放下酒杯。“等血月到了，就潜进寒月港湾的石阶底下。顺着系船链找，箱盖上有红绳。小心点，别让那些死人抓到你翻他们的货。”
      <</language>><br><br>
    <<case 3>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          Zephyr spots the dripping chest. <<He>> reaches for it, but you keep it on your side of the table. The captain laughs. "Sharp, aren't ye? A deal's a deal." <<He>> counts out <<printmoney _harbour.zephyr.fee>> in notes.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          泽菲尔一眼就看到了滴水的箱子。<<He>>伸手来拿，你却将箱子按在自己这边。船长笑了起来。“你倒不傻。老子说话算话，先给钱。”<<He>>掏出钞票，数出<<printmoney _harbour.zephyr.fee>>。
      <</language>><br><br>
      <<icon 'coldmoon-harbour/red-cord-chest.png'>><<lanLink ['Hand over the chest', '交出箱子'] 'Deadwood Coldmoon Harbour Zephyr Delivery'>>
        <<if $MoreTransformations.harbour.zephyr.stage is 3 and maplebirch.get('MoreTransformations')
          and !$combat and !$replayScene and !$statFreeze and !$frozenValues and !$possessed and !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck>>
          <<set $MoreTransformations.harbour.zephyr.stage to 4, $MoreTransformations.harbour.scene to 'zephyrPaid'>>
          <<sanity 40>><<psyche-rest 0 150>>
          <<money $MoreTransformations.harbour.zephyr.fee>><<npcincr 'Zephyr' love 2>>
          <<if !$eventforced>><<earnFeat 'Deadwood Coldmoon Cargo'>><</if>>
          <<if $pirate_rank is 1>><<pirate_status 2 'mate'>><</if>>
        <</if>>
      <</lanLink>><<gglove>><<if $pirate_rank is 1>><<ggrespect>><</if>><br>
    <<case 4>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          "Still visiting that old quay?" Zephyr asks. "Good money in salvage, if ye know what to leave alone." <<He>> raises <<his>> mug. "Ye got me cargo back from the dead. Tell that to the next fool who calls ye a landlubber."
          <br><br>
          <<if $pirate_rank is 1>>"The crew have heard all about it. Don't let it go to yer head. There's work to do."<<else>>"Want a berth aboard me ship? Ye'll still have to earn it like everyone else."<</if>>
        <<option 'CN'>>
          “还往旧码头跑呢？”泽菲尔问。“打捞是有油水，不过得知道哪些东西不能碰。”<<He>>朝你举起酒杯。“你从死人手里抢回了我的货，下回谁再叫你旱鸭子，就拿这事堵他的嘴。”
          <br><br>
          <<if $pirate_rank is 1>>“船员们都听说了。可别得意，船上还有活等着干呢。”<<else>>“至于上我的船当水手，还是得和别人一样，拿本事来换。”<</if>>
      <</language>><br><br>
  <</switch>>
<<else>>
  <<lanSwitch 'There is no sign of the captain here.' '这里没有船长的踪影。'>><br><br>
<</if>>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink [
  _harbour.zephyr.origin is 'Pirate Zephyr' ? 'Return to the deck' : 'Return to the pub',
  _harbour.zephyr.origin is 'Pirate Zephyr' ? '返回甲板' : '回到酒吧'
] `_harbour.zephyr.origin is 'Pirate Zephyr' ? 'Pirate Deck' : 'Smuggler Pub'`>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</lanLink>><br>

:: Deadwood Coldmoon Harbour Zephyr Deal
<<effects>><<deadwood-harbour-context>>
<<if $nextPassage or $nextPassageCheck>>
  <span id='next'><<lanLink ['Next', '继续'] $passage>><</lanLink>></span><<nexttext>><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<if C.npc.Zephyr.init and _harbour.zephyr.stage is 2>>
  <<npc 'Zephyr'>><<person1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<if _harbour.scene is 'zephyrBargain'>>
        "Danger money, is it?" Zephyr laughs. "Fine. But if ye drown, I'm drinking yer share."
      <<elseif _harbour.scene is 'zephyrRefused'>>
        "Nice try." Zephyr folds <<his>> arms. "The first price stands." You accept the original offer.
      <<else>>
        "That's the spirit." Zephyr raises <<his>> mug. "Stop standing about. Get me cargo back."
      <</if>>
      <br><br>
      "Bring the chest here or find me aboard ship. It's worth <<printmoney _harbour.zephyr.fee>> to ye." <<He>> leans back. "And if ye hear scratching inside, don't open it underwater."
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<if _harbour.scene is 'zephyrBargain'>>
        “还要加上卖命钱？”泽菲尔笑道。“行。不过你要是淹死了，那份钱老子就留着买酒。”
      <<elseif _harbour.scene is 'zephyrRefused'>>
        “想得倒美。”泽菲尔抱起双臂。“就刚才那个价。”你答应按原价办。
      <<else>>
        “这才像样。”泽菲尔举起酒杯。“别光站着，替老子把货找回来。”
      <</if>>
      <br><br>
      “找到了就带来这儿，或者到船上找我。<<printmoney _harbour.zephyr.fee>>，一分不少。”<<He>>靠回椅背。“还有，要是听见箱子里有抓挠声，别在水底下打开它。”
  <</language>><br><br>
<<else>>
  <<lanSwitch 'You have no new business to settle.' '眼下没有新的买卖要谈。'>><br><br>
<</if>>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink [
  _harbour.zephyr.origin is 'Pirate Zephyr' ? 'Return to the deck' : 'Return to the pub',
  _harbour.zephyr.origin is 'Pirate Zephyr' ? '返回甲板' : '回到酒吧'
] `_harbour.zephyr.origin is 'Pirate Zephyr' ? 'Pirate Deck' : 'Smuggler Pub'`>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</lanLink>><br>

:: Deadwood Coldmoon Harbour Zephyr Delivery
<<effects>><<deadwood-harbour-context>>
<<if $nextPassage or $nextPassageCheck>>
  <span id='next'><<lanLink ['Next', '继续'] $passage>><</lanLink>></span><<nexttext>><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<if C.npc.Zephyr.init and _harbour.zephyr.stage is 4 and _harbour.scene is 'zephyrPaid'>>
  <<npc 'Zephyr'>><<person1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You pocket the notes and push the wet chest across the table. Zephyr cuts the red cord and lifts the lid. Inside are oilcloth parcels and a sealed bottle. Before you can see more, <<he>> shuts it again.
      <br><br>
      "Seal's intact. Good." <<He>> taps the lid. "Expected gold, did ye? It's worth that much to me. And it's mine."
      <br><br>
      <<if $pirate_rank is 1>>"I'll tell the crew who brought it back." <<He>> claps you on the shoulder.<<else>>"Good work. If ye ever earn a berth, I could use more of that."<</if>>
      <br><br>
      You put away your payment of <<printmoney _harbour.zephyr.fee>>.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你收好钱，将湿箱子推过桌面。泽菲尔割断红绳，掀起箱盖。里面有油布包裹和一只封着口的瓶子。还没等你看清，<<he>>就合上了盖子。
      <br><br>
      “封口没破，很好。”<<He>>敲敲箱盖。“怎么，以为里面有金子？对我来说倒也差不多。不过，是我的。”
      <br><br>
      <<if $pirate_rank is 1>>“我会告诉船员们，是谁把货找回来的。”<<He>>拍了拍你的肩膀。<<else>>“干得利落。哪天上了我的船，也要有这份本事。”<</if>>
      <br><br>
      你收好<<printmoney _harbour.zephyr.fee>>报酬。
  <</language>><<gglove>><<if $pirate_rank is 1>><<ggrespect>><</if>><br><br>
<<else>>
  <<lanSwitch 'The captain has already settled your payment.' '船长已经结清了你的报酬。'>><br><br>
<</if>>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink [
  _harbour.zephyr.origin is 'Pirate Zephyr' ? 'Return to the deck' : 'Return to the pub',
  _harbour.zephyr.origin is 'Pirate Zephyr' ? '返回甲板' : '回到酒吧'
] `_harbour.zephyr.origin is 'Pirate Zephyr' ? 'Pirate Deck' : 'Smuggler Pub'`>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</lanLink>><br>
